    "title": "After Three Months in ICE Custody, a Hoboken Bartender is Back Home - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Stephanie Spear ,\n1 days ago Sebastian Pasco, a bartender at Cork City in Hoboken, was detained by immigration authorities in May 2026. After three months in custody, he is back home in Hoboken. A post from Cork City Pub shared the news via social media. On Sunday, August 16th, Cork City will host a welcome home party for Sebastian. Read on for more about what we know about Sebastian Pasco + his return to Hoboken. Read full article\n2",
